    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1177">

                <pb facs="1259" n="1163" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1163"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Corea to Mr. Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the Greater Republic of Central America</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington, D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1898-07-18"><hi rendition="#italic">July 18,
                                1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: To-day I have had the honor to receive your
                    esteemed communication of the 15th instant, which refers to the rules to which
                    neutral war vessels should conform that may desire to enter or leave the ports
                    blockaded now or which may be blockaded by the United Stated during the war with
                    Spain.</p>
                <p>I have taken due note of referred-to communication, and by the next mail I shall
                    have the honor to communicate it to my Government.</p>
                <p>I reiterate, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Luis F. Corea.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
